    <abstract id="aspace_c4d131253e52d7d352dc0f893ef18546">The Doug Ashford Papers (1983-2008) contains materials related to Ashford's work as a public artist. Ashford is a professor and artist, and most notably a member of Group Material from 1982-1996. The majority of the collection focuses on his work on the "Who Cares" Conversation series, produced with Creative Time, as well as notes and writings.</abstract>
    <langmaterial id="aspace_2865d475a22264be701bb26ef83166d8">Collection is in English with some German.</langmaterial>
